---
title: ProcessExit · how the CLI ends
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> running
  running --> waiting : CommandReturns
  waiting --> waiting : Register or Settle
  waiting --> waiting : SnapshotSettled [holds left]
  waiting --> flushing : SnapshotSettled [none left]
  flushing --> ended : EndStreams
  ended --> exited : Exit
  exited --> [*]
  note right of waiting
    INV NoExitWithPendingHold:
    no exit while held work
    (MCP, daemon, TUI) runs.
  end note
  note right of ended
    INV NoLostOutput: end() has
    delivered all written output.
  end note
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  class running live
  class waiting,flushing wait
  class exited ok
